# --- Local research data & scratch at repo ROOT (never commit interview material) ---
# Loose transcripts/subtitles/exports dropped in the repo root during local runs.
# Anchored to root (leading /) so tracked files in subdirs (e.g. tool/ANLEITUNG.txt)
# are unaffected. Put any transcript you DO want versioned in a deliberate subfolder.
/*.srt
/*.txt
/*.vtt
/*.zip
/Transcripts/
/output/
*.log
